\par\par \uc2 Film\par \b \uc2 Melania film earns $7m in US, strongest documentary debut in over a decade\b0\par\par\uc2 Edward Helmore \par \uc2 858 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 February 2026\par 15:37 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2026.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Melania, however, cost significantly more than a typical documentary, at $40m to make and $35m to promote\par \par \uc2 Amazon\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/melania-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Melania Trump}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jan/31/melania-trump-documentary-new-york-release"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 documentary}}}\uc2  has reportedly beaten box office expectations and recorded the strongest start of any documentary in over a decade, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://deadline.com/2026/02/box-office-melania-1236702845/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 taking $7m}}}\uc2  at the US box office during its lavishly promoted opening weekend. But it also cost significantly more than a typical documentary, at $40m to make and $35m to promote.\par \par \uc2 And {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/amazon"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Amazon}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 which recently cut 16,000 corporate jobs \u8211\'20\'13 has been hit with criticism that making the documentary about the first lady, and paying so highly for it, was little more than a ploy to curry favor with her husband, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2 , during his second presidency.\par \par \uc2 The film, which follows Melania Trump as she prepared to re-enter the White House in early 2025, was beaten at the box office by two horror films: Iron Lung and Rachel McAdams\u8217\'20\'19s Send Help. But it managed to beat out the action film Shelter.\par \par \uc2 Melania registered its earnings by targeting older conservatives and has been noted for carefully playing to subjects close to what are said to be interests of her husband\u8217\'20\'19s fans: patriotism, Christianity and the importance of family.\par \par \uc2 Deadline said Melania was forecast to make $5m on its debut weekend. The Hollywood Reporter said that those predictions for the \uc2 Brett Ratner\uc2 -directed documentary were \u8220\'20\'1Cbased on empty, or nearly empty, seat maps in cinemas across the country\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The outlet estimated that the film had done well with conservatives in the southern US, specifically women over the age of 55, who made up 72% of the opening-day audience.\par \par \uc2 EntTelligence, a research firm, estimated that rural theaters would contribute roughly 46% of the opening-weekend box office \u8211\'20\'13 and those in Republican counties would contribute about 53% of ticket sales. Top box office states for the film included the conservative stalwart states of Florida and Texas.\par \par \uc2 A statement from the head of Amazon MGM Studios\u8217\'20\'19 domestic theatrical distribution, Kevin Wilson, said the company was \u8220\'20\'1Cvery encouraged by the strong start and positive audience response\u8221\'20\'1D and reiterated the early box office results had exceeded expectations.\par \par \uc2 Referring to a planned follow-up documentary series about the first lady, Wilson\u8217\'20\'19s statement also said: \u8220\'20\'1CThis momentum is an important first step in what we see as a long-tail lifecycle for both the film and the forthcoming docu-series, extending well beyond the theatrical window and into what we believe will be a significant run for both on our service.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Amazon\uc2  says it operates on a different economic system from a traditional film studio, offsetting the costs of a theatrical release and promotion for distribution to 200 million subscribers to its Prime Video service.\par \par \uc2 Melania, though, has received overwhelmingly negative critical reviews. \uc2 The Guardian\uc2  judged it to be \u8220\'20\'1Cdispiriting, deadly and unrevealing\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere is a decent documentary to be made about the former model from Slovenia, but this one is unredeemable,\u8221\'20\'1D the \uc2 Guardian\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s one-star review {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/jan/30/melania-review-trump-film-is-a-gilded-trash-remake-of-the-zone-of-interest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Hollywood Reporter {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-reviews/melania-review-brett-ratner-melania-trump-documentary-1236489604/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 described}}}\uc2  it as an \u8220\'20\'1Cexpensive propaganda doc\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Ca film that fawns so lavishly over its subject that you feel downright unpatriotic not gushing over it\u8221\'20\'1D. In trailing credits, it added, the first lady\u8217\'20\'19s achievements were rolled \u8220\'20\'1Cin such laudatory fashion that North Korea would blush\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  recently told reporters he \u8220\'20\'1Cwasn\u8217\'20\'19t involved\u8221\'20\'1D in negotiations over the documentary\u8217\'20\'19s $75m price tag. Melania Trump said the producers had approached several distributors, and \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Amazon\uc2  was the best because they agreed to do theaters all around the world.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Ratner, the director \u8211\'20\'13 who had otherwise largely retreated from Hollywood {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2017/nov/20/russell-simmons-accused-of-sexual-assault-alongside-brett-ratner"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 after}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/film/2017/nov/02/director-brett-ratner-rape-accusations-sexual-harassment-claims"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 numerous}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/film/2017/nov/01/director-brett-ratner-sexual-harrassment-hollywood"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sexual misconduct allegations}}}\uc2  during the #MeToo movement \u8211\'20\'13 was pointedly asked at the Melania premiere if he felt he was part of a larger quid pro quo.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThat\u8217\'20\'19s ridiculous, but it\u8217\'20\'19s OK, I\u8217\'20\'19ll answer,\u8221\'20\'1D he said. \u8220\'20\'1CI can tell you right now, if we were audited and they said, \u8216\'20\'18How much was spent on this movie?\u8217\'20\'19 This movie is one of the most expensive movies \u8211\'20\'13 documentaries \u8211\'20\'13 in the genre ever made.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt wasn\u8217\'20\'19t about getting rich. I mean, I think the Trumps are wealthy and successful enough. This is about giving me the ability to hire the best crew in the world, to not only score the film with the best composer \u8230\'20\'26 I mean, when you see the movie, you\u8217\'20\'19ll go, \u8216\'20\'18Oh, we see where the money went now.\u8217\'20\'19 This wasn\u8217\'20\'19t about corruption. Melania only cared about one thing \u8211\'20\'13 making a great movie for audiences.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 On the same day Melania opened in theaters, Ratner appeared in photos published by Trump\u8217\'20\'19s justice department as part of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jan/30/epstein-files-3-million-new-pages"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 release}}}\uc2  of 3m files pertaining to late convicted sex offender \uc2 Jeffrey Epstein\uc2 . The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thedailybeast.com/melania-doc-director-found-in-creepy-epstein-files-photos/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 photos}}}\uc2  show Ratner in pictures alongside Epstein, including while wrapping his arms around a woman between them.\par \par \uc2 Ratner has not publicly commented.\par \par \uc2 People mentioned in or seen in pictures included in the so-called Epstein files have not been implicated in or convicted of crimes. Many notable people who associated with Epstein, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jul/18/trump-epstein-friendship"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 former friend}}}\uc2  of Trump, have denied wrongdoing.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020260201em21002ut\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
