\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Trump Organization\uc2  sought to bring in nearly 200 workers on visas in 2025\b0\par\par\uc2 Richard Luscombe in Miami \par \uc2 417 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 November 2025\par 16:18 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 President\u8217\'20\'19s family business requested at least 184 foreign workers for Mar-a-Lago, Virginia winery and two golf clubs\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s family business increased the pace at which it hired foreign workers on temporary visas this year, even as his administration was placing obstacles in the way of other businesses that wanted to do the same, a report published Thursday claimed.\par \par \uc2 According to Forbes, which analyzed data from the \uc2 US Department of Labor\uc2 , the \uc2 Trump Organization\uc2  sought to bring in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.forbes.com/sites/zacheverson/2025/11/12/trump-organization-record-foreign-workers-visas-2025/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 at least 184 foreign workers}}}\uc2  in 2025 for temporary positions at the US president\u8217\'20\'19s Mar-a-Lago resort in Florida, two golf clubs and his Virginia winery.\par \par \uc2 The number of applications for H-2A and H-2B visas covering temporary workers including servers, clerks, housekeepers, kitchen staff and farm workers was the highest ever submitted by the company, and up from 121 in 2021, when Trump\u8217\'20\'19s first term of office ended.\par \par \uc2 It was also the fifth time in 10 years that Trump had sought to bring in more than 100 overseas workers for seasonal jobs at Mar-a-Lago, according to data {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.palmbeachpost.com/story/news/local/2025/09/23/as-mar-a-lago-visa-use-grows-what-is-the-future-of-h-2b-program/86295192007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seen by the Palm Beach Post}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The revelation comes amid a crackdown on legal immigration by his administration that has included the introduction of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2025/oct/01/trumps-h-1b-visa-healthcare-immigration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $100,000 fee on H1-B visas}}}\uc2  for skilled foreign workers; extra scrutiny of the actions and activities of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/oct/11/trump-legal-immigration-crackdown"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 55 million people who already hold US visas}}}\uc2 ; and restrictive new rules for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/29/trump-immigration-visa-restrictions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 foreign students and journalists}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Overall, Forbes reported, the \uc2 Trump Organization\uc2  sought to employ 566 foreign laborers over the five years Trump has been in the White House, from 2017 to 2021, and during 2025.\par \par \uc2 Notably, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehill.com/homenews/administration/5602002-trump-greene-foreign-policy/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump was criticized}}}\uc2  by some in the Republican party this week for comments on Fox News defending the need for foreign workers when a company was unable to find people with \u8220\'20\'1Cspecific talents\u8221\'20\'1D to fill particular roles.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYou can\u8217\'20\'19t just say a country is coming in, going to invest $10bn to build a plant, and going to take people off an unemployment line who haven\u8217\'20\'19t worked in five years, and they\u8217\'20\'19re going to start making their missiles. It doesn\u8217\'20\'19t work that well,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.foxnews.com/politics/trumps-backing-h-1b-visa-program-exposes-cracks-within-maga-movement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told host Laura Ingraham}}}\uc2  after she suggested foreign workers undercut the wages of US workers.\par \par \uc2 The White House declined Forbes\u8217\'20\'19 request for comment, and the \uc2 Trump Organization\uc2  did not immediately respond to an inquiry.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020251113elbd004h7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
