\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Threat to US vaccines as CDC staff supporting key advisory panel laid off\b0\par\par\uc2 Melody Schreiber \par \uc2 1,205 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 October 2025\par 15:31 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Critics say scientists \u8216\'20\'18held hostage\u8217\'20\'19 by RFK Jr as changes mean vaccine development and guidance in peril\par \par \uc2 The staff supporting the \uc2 Advisory Committee on Immunization Practices\uc2  (ACIP) were let go earlier this month in a sweeping round of layoffs that gutted entire departments of the \uc2 US Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC)\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Most of the committee\u8217\'20\'19s working groups, which pore over data and help set the agendas, haven\u8217\'20\'19t met for months, and there was little communication from the staff even before they received reduction in force (RIF) notices during the \uc2 US government\uc2  shutdown.\par \par \uc2 The ACIP meeting planned for 22-23 October has been indefinitely postponed.\par \par \uc2 The changes mean the \uc2 US government\uc2  may not make routine vaccine recommendations for more than half of children in 2026, and they will likely affect the development and recommendation of new vaccines in the pipeline.\par \par \uc2 The ACIP made headlines in June when \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr\uc2 , the US health secretary, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jun/11/rfk-jr-new-vaccine-advisers-panel"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 replaced}}}\uc2  all of the independent vaccine advisers with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jun/13/eight-new-cdc-vaccine-advisers-robert-f-kennedy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 his own handpicked advisers}}}\uc2 , an unprecedented move.\par \par \uc2 Some of these advisers, as well as others {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/sep/18/cdc-vaccine-committee"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  in September, are vocal anti-vaccine activists. But the work of the committee isn\u8217\'20\'19t done only by the independent advisers; it is supported by CDC staff and outside experts on working groups.\par \par \uc2 The CDC staff provide logistical support and subject-matter expertise, and they make sure the committee follows rules and regulations.\par \par \uc2 The entire department is now \u8220\'20\'1Cgone\u8221\'20\'1D, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/aug/31/cdc-demetre-daskalakis-rfk-jr-health"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Demetre Daskalakis}}}\uc2 , former director of the National Center for Immunization and Respiratory Diseases, said last week at a press conference with Defend America Action. Only a designated federal official for the group remains, he said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCDC scientists are being held hostage by \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D Daskalakis added.\par \par \uc2 With the ACIP staff, \u8220\'20\'1Ca lot of what they do is logistics,\u8221\'20\'1D said Kevin Ault, an obstetrician-gynecologist at the Western Michigan University Homer Stryker MD School of Medicine.\par \par \uc2 In recent meetings, \u8220\'20\'1Cyou\u8217\'20\'19ve kind of seen that fall apart\u8221\'20\'1D, he said.\par \par \uc2 Some presentations weren\u8217\'20\'19t available for the most recent meeting, and several \uc2 Zoom\uc2  meeting links and microphones weren\u8217\'20\'19t working. The language of the votes wasn\u8217\'20\'19t distributed to the public or apparently to the advisers ahead of time, with one committee member objecting to a vote because of the lack of information. With the support staff now gone, such delays and mistakes may worsen.\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s not just scientists and staff within the agency feeling the effects of terminations and shakeups.\par \par \uc2 The ACIP\u8217\'20\'19s working groups are often composed of subject experts, local health department officials, and representatives from medical groups in addition to CDC employees. There are usually eight to ten working groups at a given time focusing on pathogens such as influenza, respiratory syncytial virus (RSV), human papillomavirus (HPV), and cytomegalovirus (CMV).\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe usually do the very boring job of slogging through the data and deciding what information is most important to present at the public meeting,\u8221\'20\'1D Ault said.\par \par \uc2 Most working groups have not met in at least six months. Ault was in a meeting for the working group on RSV in June when the news broke that all 17 advisers on the ACIP \u8211\'20\'13 some of whom were leading the session \u8211\'20\'13 were {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jun/09/rfk-cdc-panel-vaccines-removed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 being fired}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey weren\u8217\'20\'19t informed ahead of time. It was in the Wall Street Journal and somebody happened to be on the call and said, \u8216\'20\'18Hey, did you guys know you just got fired?\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D Ault said.\par \par \uc2 Since then, Ault has attended no meetings and received little word from staff.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/oct/04/cdc-rfk-jr-infectious-disease-testimony"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 A \u8216\'20\'18hostile takeover\u8217\'20\'19: ousted CDC official raises alarm over RFK Jr approach to infectious disease}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe only communication I\u8217\'20\'19ve gotten has been usually the day of a scheduled meeting \u8211\'20\'13 that it\u8217\'20\'19s been canceled. Other than that, I\u8217\'20\'19ve not gotten much communication at all,\u8221\'20\'1D Ault said.\par \par \uc2 Ault was an ACIP member from 2018 to 2022. He has been on the flu working group on and off since the flu pandemic of 2009, and he\u8217\'20\'19s the chair of the scheduling committee.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMost of them have not met in six months or more,\u8221\'20\'1D Ault said. \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s been very fragmented and haphazard.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The flu recommendations were published in August despite no meeting of the working group, which meant experts and medical groups had no input on the recommendations.\par \par \uc2 Representatives from some groups received an unsigned email in August saying their input was no longer needed. The disinvited groups included the \uc2 American Medical Association\uc2 , the \uc2 American Academy of Pediatrics\uc2  and the \uc2 Infectious Diseases Society of America\uc2 . Other representatives, including from the \uc2 American College of Obstetricians and Gynecologists (ACOG)\uc2 , haven\u8217\'20\'19t received word on whether they are still participating in the working groups, Ault said.\par \par \uc2 One apparent exception to the pause on working groups is the new Covid vaccine group headed by Retsef Levi, a professor of operations management at the MIT Sloan School of Management and one of the new vaccine advisers. It\u8217\'20\'19s not clear who is on the Covid committee and whether they are following the usual processes for working groups.\par \par \uc2 Working group members have presented data at ACIP meetings since the shakeup. But they\u8217\'20\'19ve been \u8220\'20\'1Csidelined\u8221\'20\'1D, Daskalakis said. \u8220\'20\'1CThey\u8217\'20\'19re only, in effect, providing data that frankly is being just criticized and ignored.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A meeting planned for October has been rescheduled \u8220\'20\'1CTBD\u8221\'20\'1D, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cdc.gov/acip/meetings/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to the ACIP website.\par \par \uc2 A vaccine schedule should be published by the CDC by 1 January, and Vaccines for Children \u8211\'20\'13 a program that provides vaccines to 52% of children in the US \u8211\'20\'13 depends on that schedule, Ault said.\par \par \uc2 Normally, the schedule would have been published in the Morbidity and Mortality Weekly Report, but that publication is temporarily closed during the government shutdown. And the schedule would\u8217\'20\'19ve been discussed at the October meeting.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll the vaccines for children and to some extent adults are at risk if that job does not get done in the next two and a half months,\u8221\'20\'1D Ault said.\par \par \uc2 Gutting the committee also means promising new vaccines in the late stages of clinical trials may never be recommended, he added.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t know what the future holds for new vaccines that are on the near horizon. The path forward just seems very murky.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 With the termination of ACIP staff, \u8220\'20\'1Cit\u8217\'20\'19s like the operating system for the advisory committee is gone\u8221\'20\'1D, Daskalakis said. \u8220\'20\'1CThe hardware is there, the software is there\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 but there\u8217\'20\'19s no way to make the system run, he said.\par \par \uc2 The RIFs, which also affected departments including human resources, could limit what happens with the committee in the future, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/oct/04/cdc-rfk-jr-infectious-disease-testimony"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Debra Houry}}}\uc2 , former chief medical officer for the CDC, said at the same press conference with Daskalakis.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf they want to add any new members, HR is gone. The entire HR for CDC is gone. That\u8217\'20\'19s who brings on the special government employees and new FACA [Federal Advisory Committee Act] members,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 The ethics office was also entirely let go. If \u8220\'20\'1Cthese folks have a baseline conflict of interest, we\u8217\'20\'19ll never know, because they\u8217\'20\'19re not going to be assessed anymore by the ethics office\u8221\'20\'1D, Daskalakis said. \u8220\'20\'1CThat\u8217\'20\'19s another pretty significant red flag.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020251027elar002mh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
