\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 Giorgia Meloni\uc2  condemns Italian union leader for \u8216\'20\'18Trump courtesan\u8217\'20\'19 remark\b0\par\par\uc2 Angela Giuffrida in Rome \par \uc2 466 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 October 2025\par 13:19 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Prime minister says CGIL head is \u8216\'20\'18clouded by resentment\u8217\'20\'19 and accuses the left of hypocrisy towards women\par \par \uc2 Giorgia Meloni\uc2  has condemned the boss of Italy\u8217\'20\'19s biggest trade union after he referred to the prime minister as the \u8220\'20\'1Ccourtesan\u8221\'20\'1D of Donald Trump.\par \par \uc2 Maurizio Landini, the leader of CGIL, which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2025/oct/03/italy-gaza-protests-raise-pressure-on-giorgia-meloni"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 organised several pro-Palestinian protests before the Gaza ceasefire deal,}}}\uc2  made the remarks on TV on Tuesday, the day after world leaders, including Meloni, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/oct/14/donald-trump-gaza-summit-praise-insults-world-leaders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 met in Egypt for a Middle East peace summit}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Landini accused Meloni of \u8220\'20\'1Cnot having lifted a finger\u8221\'20\'1D to bring peace in Gaza, limiting her role to \u8220\'20\'1Cplaying Trump\u8217\'20\'19s courtesan\u8221\'20\'1D. \u8220\'20\'1CFortunately, the Italian citizens took to the street to defend the dignity and honour of this country,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 In a post on social media on Thursday, Meloni said Landini was \u8220\'20\'1Cevidently clouded by a mounting resentment (which I can understand)\u8221\'20\'1D, before sharing a definition of \u8220\'20\'1Ccourtesan\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think everyone knows the most common meaning attributed to this word, but, for the benefit of those who might not, I\u8217\'20\'19m publishing the first definition found through a quick internet search,\u8221\'20\'1D Meloni said, posting a screenshot that read: \u8220\'20\'1CWoman of easy virtue, heterosexual; euphemism, prostitute.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Meloni also criticised her leftwing opponents, saying that for decades they had \u8220\'20\'1Clectured us on respect for women\u8221\'20\'1D only to then criticise a woman by \u8220\'20\'1Ccalling her a prostitute\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 In response to the post, Landini argued there were \u8220\'20\'1Cno sexist insults\u8221\'20\'1D towards Meloni and that he had used the term to imply \u8220\'20\'1CTrump\u8217\'20\'19s lackey\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 In a statement, he said: \u8220\'20\'1CIn a 10-minute interview, which anyone can easily rewatch, to avoid any misunderstanding or exploitation of the term used, I immediately clarified what I meant \u8211\'20\'13 that Meloni was on the coat tails of Trump, she was at Trump\u8217\'20\'19s court, she was Trump\u8217\'20\'19s lackey.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Meloni has long sought to nurture friendly relations with the US president. During {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/oct/14/donald-trump-gaza-summit-praise-insults-world-leaders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a speech in Egypt}}}\uc2 , Trump turned to Meloni \u8211\'20\'13 the only woman at the event \u8211\'20\'13 and called her \u8220\'20\'1Cbeautiful\u8221\'20\'1D. \u8220\'20\'1CIn the United States, it would be the end of your political career,\u8221\'20\'1D he said. \u8220\'20\'1CBut I\u8217\'20\'19ll take the risk. Do you mind if I say you\u8217\'20\'19re beautiful? Because you truly are beautiful.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The US president later praised her as \u8220\'20\'1Can inspiration to all\u8221\'20\'1D in reference to the English version of her book, I Am Giorgia: My Roots, My Principles, which has a foreword by his son Donald Trump Jr.\par \par \uc2 In August, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2025/aug/29/giorgia-meloni-disgusted-at-posting-of-photos-of-her-and-other-women-on-porn-site"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Meloni also hit back}}}\uc2  after discovering that doctored photos of her and other prominent Italian women had been posted on a pornographic website, saying she was \u8220\'20\'1Cdisgusted\u8221\'20\'1D and expressing \u8220\'20\'1Csolidarity and support to all the women who have been offended, insulted and violated\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020251017elah003ux\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
